# Ephemeral memsearch indexer artifacts.
# Both are rewritten on every index run, so tracking them adds a spurious
# delete/re-add to each `daily-backup` commit without preserving any history:
#   .memsearch-index.lock     presence-only lock; meaningless outside a live run
#   .memsearch-index.log      overwritten status line ("Indexed N chunks."), not appended
#   .memsearch-timeout-streak 1-byte counter; daily-backup.ps1:394 deletes it each run
# .errors.log is deliberately NOT ignored - it is the surfaced error channel.
transcripts/.memsearch-index.lock
transcripts/.memsearch-index.log
transcripts/.memsearch-timeout-streak
